The data records in this package (`records/`) are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Exceptions: a source with its own reuse terms names them in its `license` field (SPDX id) and
keeps them. Records of data a manufacturer published (a source with `origin` `manufacturer`, such as a
load table) carry no project licence: the manufacturer's own terms apply, as its source states them
in `terms`. Parameters fitted to such data (`interior` of a powder, sources of kind `fitted`) are the project's own result and fall under CC BY 4.0.

Third-party facts: CC BY 4.0 covers only the project's own selection, structure and drawings.
The project claims no rights in facts taken from third-party sources (C.I.P. sheets, federation
rule books). The project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Bundesverwaltungsamt (BVA),
the shooting sport federations or the C.I.P.

Attribution: "OpenReloading data records", with a link to the repository and the source named in
each record's provenance where the source requires it.

The code is licensed under the MIT license (LICENSE-MIT in the package, ../../LICENSE in the repository).
